  "details": "When opening VR chat, there seems to be some clipping with the avatar pedestal (when viewing / selecting avatars)\n\nTo replicate this issue 1. I booted up the game after closing the app. (So it’s a fresh boot) 2. Then I would open the menu and navigate to the avatar selector tab 3. select an avatar whether that be a private or public avatar 4. then you can see that the avatar is clipped in the middle of the menu 5. After selecting the avatar and closing the menu when I reopen the menu and select the same avatar or any other avatar, the avatar is in the correct placement.\n\nVersion: 2025.1.3 (375) iOS 18.4.1 on the iPhone 16 pro max",
